== Overview ==
'''Helicopter Rocket Launcher Toilet''' is a toilet that has average speed with decent health and can stun units. It appears in [[Hard Mode]] and [[Nightmare Mode]] and in Endless Mode.

== Appearance ==
It has a rocket launcher on the bottom and a helicopter rotor. The toilet is grey and is also small.
