=== Nightmare Mode ===
== Strategy ==
Decent DPS but fast are recommended because it doesn't have a crazy amount of health, though it still has a bit.

== Trivia ==
* On the Episode 55 Update, Helicopter Rocket Launcher Toilet was broken and stopped moving when it hit a corner.
* It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Helicopter_Missile_Grey_Skibidi_Toilet Helicopter Missile Grey Skibidi Toilet] from the series.

